== CM-CPT  ball3 x [0, oo): drivable, closed, convex, NOT compact; (SEC) fails with full effects
  [ok  ] rot3 x id preserves |u|^2 and fixes the 4th coordinate s   (identity)
  [ok  ] J_off_axis inherited: (cyc3 rot3(pi) cyc3^-1)(e3, 0) = (-e3, 0), rot3(s)(e3) = e3 (witness)
  [ok  ] z = 0 is a boundary state: z + eps(z - (0,0,0,1)) = (0,0,0,-eps) not in Om (witness)
  [ok  ] deduce d = 0: for d = +-dp != 0, s = 2/dp gives |e(0,s) - e(0,0)| = |d s| = 2 > 1 (deduce)
  [note] deduce a = 0 from 1 + a_i <= 1 and 1 - a_i <= 1, so e is identically 1 (not proper)  (written step, not a check)
  [ok  ] control: ball3 x [0, 1] (compact) has the proper effect 1 - s certain at z = 0 (witness)

